{"2397440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Momogatari", "steam_appid": 2397440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momogatari is a <strong>2D action Metroidvania</strong> focused on <strong>expressive combat, constant adaptation, and mastery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Momotaro</strong>, a young warrior descending into <strong>Yomi</strong>, a dark realm of spirits, Yokai, and ancient Kami drawn from Japanese folklore.<br>Armed with a sacred weapon capable of <strong>instant sword switching</strong>, you must adapt your fighting style on the fly, overcome relentless enemies, and uncover the truth behind a curse threatening someone dear to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is designed to challenge your <strong>decision-making</strong>, not just your reflexes.<br>Victory comes from observation, timing, and choosing the right tool at the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/841d04c7e97f2899d105699a4f7c9d6a.poster.avif?t=1770761061\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/841d04c7e97f2899d105699a4f7c9d6a.webm?t=1770761061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/841d04c7e97f2899d105699a4f7c9d6a.mp4?t=1770761061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sword Switching Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch instantly between multiple sword forms, each with distinct mechanics and combat roles.<br>Adapt mid-fight to enemy behavior, positioning, and pressure to maintain control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tight, Combat-Driven Platforming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement and combat are deeply connected.<br>Precise jumps, dashes, and positioning are essential to maintaining flow and momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/0a6ffd64ed62d6e1065b25775196e02b.poster.avif?t=1770761061\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/0a6ffd64ed62d6e1065b25775196e02b.webm?t=1770761061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/0a6ffd64ed62d6e1065b25775196e02b.mp4?t=1770761061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Enemies &amp; Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face carefully designed enemies and climactic boss fights built around <strong>unique mechanics</strong> that reward learning and mastery over trial-and-error.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meaningful Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your playstyle through a dedicated skill tree focused on impactful upgrades to combat, mobility, and special abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Challenges</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swarm Challenges</strong> testing crowd control and spatial awareness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shikigami</strong> companions offering tactical options in combat and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-based Drum Challenges</strong> where timing is key</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World Inspired by Japanese Folklore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an interconnected world rooted in myth, spirits, and forgotten legends, brought to life with an <strong>adaptive soundtrack</strong> infused with traditional Japanese instruments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/d7dc2ad612d7fb3848d09289e42a4db5.poster.avif?t=1770761061\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/d7dc2ad612d7fb3848d09289e42a4db5.webm?t=1770761061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/d7dc2ad612d7fb3848d09289e42a4db5.mp4?t=1770761061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momogatari is a <strong>2D action Metroidvania</strong> focused on <strong>expressive combat, constant adaptation, and mastery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Momotaro</strong>, a young warrior descending into <strong>Yomi</strong>, a dark realm of spirits, Yokai, and ancient Kami drawn from Japanese folklore.<br>Armed with a sacred weapon capable of <strong>instant sword switching</strong>, you must adapt your fighting style on the fly, overcome relentless enemies, and uncover the truth behind a curse threatening someone dear to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is designed to challenge your <strong>decision-making</strong>, not just your reflexes.<br>Victory comes from observation, timing, and choosing the right tool at the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/841d04c7e97f2899d105699a4f7c9d6a.poster.avif?t=1770761061\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/841d04c7e97f2899d105699a4f7c9d6a.webm?t=1770761061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/841d04c7e97f2899d105699a4f7c9d6a.mp4?t=1770761061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sword Switching Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch instantly between multiple sword forms, each with distinct mechanics and combat roles.<br>Adapt mid-fight to enemy behavior, positioning, and pressure to maintain control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tight, Combat-Driven Platforming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement and combat are deeply connected.<br>Precise jumps, dashes, and positioning are essential to maintaining flow and momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/0a6ffd64ed62d6e1065b25775196e02b.poster.avif?t=1770761061\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/0a6ffd64ed62d6e1065b25775196e02b.webm?t=1770761061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/0a6ffd64ed62d6e1065b25775196e02b.mp4?t=1770761061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Enemies &amp; Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face carefully designed enemies and climactic boss fights built around <strong>unique mechanics</strong> that reward learning and mastery over trial-and-error.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meaningful Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your playstyle through a dedicated skill tree focused on impactful upgrades to combat, mobility, and special abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Challenges</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swarm Challenges</strong> testing crowd control and spatial awareness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shikigami</strong> companions offering tactical options in combat and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-based Drum Challenges</strong> where timing is key</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World Inspired by Japanese Folklore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an interconnected world rooted in myth, spirits, and forgotten legends, brought to life with an <strong>adaptive soundtrack</strong> infused with traditional Japanese instruments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/d7dc2ad612d7fb3848d09289e42a4db5.poster.avif?t=1770761061\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/d7dc2ad612d7fb3848d09289e42a4db5.webm?t=1770761061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397440/extras/d7dc2ad612d7fb3848d09289e42a4db5.mp4?t=1770761061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Explore the Yomi world with a sacred weapon that can change sword types. Fight different &quot;Yokai&quot; and challenge the &quot;Kami&quot; of this world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<stron